  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## The recordings\n\n- **soulive2014-12-12.akg483.flac16** (recommended): source not stated; 7 songs; 49 min; rated 4/5 by 1 [1]. Said about its sound: Reviewer finds the sound crisp and clean with no mud; bass can be added through EQ if wanted [5]\n- **soulive2014-12-12.dpa4011.flac24**: source not stated; 7 songs; 50 min [2]\n- **soulive2014-12-12.dpa4011.flac16**: source not stated; 7 songs; 50 min [3]\n- **soulive2014-12-12.akg483.flac24**: source not stated; 7 songs; 49 min [4]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Reviewer judges from this recording and the TTB sets that it was an exceptional night, and hopes the 12/13 Soulive set was taped too [5]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **soulive2014-12-12.akg483.flac16**: taped by vanark; transferred by vanark; source: AKG C480B/CK63 > Tascam DR-60D (24/48) [1]\n- **soulive2014-12-12.dpa4011.flac24**: taped by Brian V.; transferred by Brian V.; source: DPA 4011 > V3 Digital > R44 (24/96) [2]. Also: Edited in Sound Forge Pro 10 (normalized, fades), tracked in CD Wav, then converted to FLAC level 8; 24-bit, not for CD burning [2]\n- **soulive2014-12-12.dpa4011.flac16**: taped by Brian V.; transferred by Brian V.; source: DPA 4011 > V3 Digital > R44 (24/96) [3]. Also: Brian V.'s DPA 4011 > V3 Digital > R44 24/96 recording, resampled with iZotope SRC and dithered with MBIT+ to 16-bit FLAC [3]\n- **soulive2014-12-12.akg483.flac24**: taped by vanark; transferred by vanark; source: AKG C480B/CK63 > Tascam DR-60D (24/48) [4]. Also: Recorded by vanark with AKG C480B/CK63 microphones into a Tascam DR-60D at 24/48, edited in Wavelab 6.10, then FLAC level 8; Labeled a Team Dirty South recording; the setlist came from Brian V [4]",
